  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Feasibility Study - Malaysia-U.S. Submarine Cable System Feasibility Study, through T Soja &amp; Associates, Inc.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A USTDA grant for Malaysian company Hexa Capital Consultancy (Hexa) is funding a feasibility study to support the development of the he MYUS submarine fiber optic cable system (MYUS Cable System) that will provide a direct link between Southeast Asia and the United States and add critical capacity for secure and cost-effective digital connectivity in the Asia-Pacific region.</narrative>
